<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AMP Office Trust units list at premium.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AMP Office Trust units list at premium.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Units in AMP Office Trust made their debut on the Australian Stock Exchange at A$1.12, an 18 percent premium on its issue price of 95 cents.</p>
<p>The property trust offering saw 185.69 million units offered to the public out of a total of 353.5 million units on issue.</p>
<p>The Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP) has a 44.86 percent interest in the trust, holding 158.56 million units.</p>
<p>By 2.15 p.m. (0315 GMT), AMP Office Trust units had settled at A$1.10, up 15 cents on the issue price on turnover of 16.07 million units.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
